  "description": "26\" Single Speed Beach Cruiser Bike for Women\n\nThe 26\" Single Speed Beach Cruiser Bike for Women combines style and comfort. Featuring a durable Hi-ten steel frame, a comfortable black leatherette saddle with springs, and wide tires for a smooth ride, it's perfect for leisurely beach cruises or casual rides around town. The coaster brake offers easy stopping, and the steel kickstand ensures stable parking. Ideal for women looking for a relaxed and enjoyable biking experience.\n\nFRAME\n\nTracer Hi-ten steel Classical 26*16\"\n\nFORK\n\nTracer Hi-ten Steel 3/8\"*22.2*25.4*167*28.6*1.4*367*102mm\n\nSHOCK\n\nN/A\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nTracer Steel Moon-Type 680*22.2*1.4T\n\nSTEM\n\nAlloy 22.2*25.4*180mm Heavy Duty, Ext:80mm\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nSteel for One Piece Cranks\n\nFRONT HUB\n\nSF-HB03F, 3/8\"*14G*36H*100*140mm\n\nREAR HUB\n\nLC-201R coaster, 3/8*14G*36H*110*150mm\n\nSPOKES\n\nSteel 14G\n\nTIRES\n\nBlack, 26\"x2.125\n\nFENDERS\n\nN/A\n\nMEAS\n\n139*18*68cm\n\nEXTRAS\n\nReflectors, steel kickstand\n\nWEIGHT\n\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
